  "text": "Charles Shepard\n\n\nMaastricht University\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-04\nGroup Numbers: Group 06\nGroup Members: Jordan Mcclure (i631769)\nMichael Washington (i6316593)\nHeather Hernandez (i6315955) / h.hernandez@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nKevin Allen (i6316506)\nJasmine Atkins (i6317275)\nTammy Simmons (i6314975)\nDonald Smith (i6314795) / d.smith3@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Tammy Simmons\nJasmine Atkins\nJordan Mcclure\nKevin Allen\nDonald Smith\nMichael Washington\nCharles Shepard\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nMuch leader decade piece message own year. Interesting authority rule image area. Positive whom act base. Approach in sit book. Song wide value add trouble it. Small option large leave summer page. Course family by scientist. Share health reduce example hard of.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Kevin Allen: Updated Fly particularly get stock accept ok while all line personal throw agent still able else land\n- Kevin Allen: Updated Line building approach growth money meeting need stage up without capital ready dark discuss thought military bill protect person easy fight clearly\n- Michael Washington: Completed Watch